$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM To a 1 L flash was charged compound 12 (64.3 g, 154 mmol), HOBt (5.0 g,
16 mmol) and CH3CN (300 mL), and the reaction solution was cooled to 5-10
ºC. Compound 6 (24.9 g, 160 mmol) and EDC.HCl (38.0 g, 84.5 mmol)were
added and the mixture aged for 3 h at 5-10 ºC under N2 until HPLC
analysis indicated completion of the reaction. IPAc (600 mL) was added
and 1% HCl (250 mL) with the pH value of aqueous layer ~2. The layers
were separated and the aqueous layer was extracted with IPAc twice. The
combined organic layers were then washed with 5% NaHCO3 and 25% brine,
then concentrated in vacuo. Compound 13 (75.5 g) in 89% corrected yield.
Tert-butyl
(2S,4R)-4-((3-chloro-7-methoxyquinoxalin-2-yl)oxy)-2-(((1R,2S)-1-(ethoxycarbonyl)-2-vinylcyclopropyl)
carbamoyl)pyrrolidine-1-carboxylate (13). 1H NMR (500 MHz, CD3CN): δ 1.21
(t, J = 7.11 Hz, 3 H), 1.35-1.38 (m, 1 H), 1.41 (s, 9 H), 1.74 (m, 1 H),
2.18-2.22 (m, 1 H), 2.44-2.61 (m, 3 H), 3.83-3.87 (m, 2H), 3.93 (s, 3 H),
4.08-4.16 (m, 2 H), 4.29-4.35 (m, 1 H), 5.12 (d, J = 10.22 Hz, 1 H), 5.31
(d, J = 17.24 Hz, 1 H), 5.77-5.68 (m, 2 H), 7.20 (d, J = 2.78 Hz, 1 H),
7.25 (dd, J = 9.11, 2.79 Hz, 1 H), 7.38-7.45 (br NH, 1 H), 7.78 (d, J =
9.11 Hz, 1 H); 13C NMR (125 MHz, CD3CN): δ 13.7, 22.2, 26.3, 27.6, 33.0,
34.8, 36.4, 39.2, 52.1, 55.7, 59.6, 61.1, 75.5, 79.8, 105.9, 119.5,
128.8, 133.7, (134.2), 136.2, 141.1, 152.7, 161.4, 170.0, (173.1). HRMS
(ESI) calculated for C27H34ClN4O7 + (M+H): 561.2116. Found: 561.2118.
